    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm sitting on a local school board and we're voting on the new social studies curriculum for the middle schoolers. i'm trying to decide which way to go. is it better to have a curriculum that focuses on national triumphs and our shared values, or one that emphasizes systemic injustices and power struggles? which one actually works better for kids?",
